    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293-a2">

                <pb facs="0486" n="414" sameAs="frus:frus1882/pg414"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Corralitos, Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1882-03-21"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 21,
                        1882</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">General <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mackenzie</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Santa Fé, N. Mex.:</hi></p>
                <p>Ju, Apache chief, here. Think he will go for San Carlos. Has stolen ninety-three
                    head of horses and mules from me. He has eight captive American children. Refer
                    you to Richard Hudson, Grant County, N. Mex., who is here at present, for
                    particulars. Any message to him will be forwarded to me. Any facilities you
                    require will be furnished by me, should you happen to cross the line.</p>
                <closer><signed>GEO. B. ZIMPLEMAN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
